WEBVTT

00:07:59.416 --> 00:08:02.452
all of which can enhance
our job performance.

00:08:02.476 --> 00:08:05.585
But Arthur doesn't think that's enough
to keep us from declining.

00:08:05.609 --> 00:08:09.145
AB: Everybody falls in their game
at some particular point.

00:08:09.169 --> 00:08:11.371
AG: At what age do you think
the average person

00:08:11.395 --> 00:08:13.886
is going to start to face
significant career decline?

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:17.029
AB: I've got to give you
the social scientist answer -- it depends

00:08:17.029 --> 00:08:18.188
but if I were to guess,

00:08:18.212 --> 00:08:21.760
I've got to say that in your mid-40s
is when you're likely to see the peak

00:08:21.784 --> 00:08:23.808
of your originality and creativity,

00:08:23.832 --> 00:08:26.141
and you should be making plans in your 40s

00:08:26.165 --> 00:08:29.275
to how you can be the best creator

00:08:29.299 --> 00:08:31.083
with your crystallized intelligence,